    "answer": {
      "short": "Yes, with $36\\text{ cm}$ to spare.",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}3.4\\text{ m}&=3.4\\times100\\text{ cm}\\\\&=340\\text{ cm}\\end{align*}$$\nSince $340\\text{ cm}<376\\text{ cm}$, the truck will fit under the bridge.\n$$\\begin{align*}\\text{Room to spare}&=376\\text{ cm}-340\\text{ cm}\\\\&=36\\text{ cm}\\end{align*}$$",
